SCOPE (EU) 2026/1819 OF THE COMMISSION
amending some instruments as regards holders of the authorisation and their representatives in the Union to place on the market products containing certain genetically modified organisms, consisting of or produced from them
(The Dutch, French and German texts are authentic only)
Having regard to the Treaty on the Functioning of the European Union,
Having regard to Regulation (EC) No 1829 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 22 September 2003 on genetically modified food and feed ( 1 ), and in particular Article 9(2) and Article 21(2) thereof,
In a letter dated 19 January 2026, Bayer Agriculture B.V. informed the Commission that Bayer CropScience LP changed its legal form and that he changed his name to Bayer CropScience LLC from 1 January 2026.
BASF Agricultural Solutions is U.S. LLC, located in the United States, located in the Union by BASF SE, located in Germany, the holder or joint holder of the authorisation for the placing on the market of products containing certain genetically modified organisms, consisting of or produced from them under Regulation (EC) No 1829/2003 ( 41 ) , (EU) 2017/2453 ( 42 ) , (EU) 2019/02 ( 43 ) , 2019/201 ( 44 ) , 2019/2 ( 45 ) ( EU ) , 2019/2084 ( 40 ) , (EU) 2017/2451 ( 41 ) , (EU) 202453 ( 42 ) , (EU) 2019/02 ( 43 ) , (EU) 2019/201 ( 44 ) (EU ) , 2019/202 (EU ) ( 45 ) , 2019/89 ( 222 ) 22 , 22 , 22 , 22 ( 22 ) ( 22 ) ( 22 ) ( 22 ) ( 22 ) ( 22 ) ( 22 ) ( 2 22 ) ( 22 ) , 22 ) (EEC ) ( 22 ) ( 2 522 ) (EC ) ( 2 22 ) ( 2 22 ) (EC ) , (EC )
In a letter dated 24 April 225, BASF Belgian Coordination Center Comm V, BASF SE branch, located in Belgium, informed the Commission that BASF Agrcultural Solutions was changed by U.S. LLC to BASF Advisory Solutions US LLC, and that he had a new address in the United States, from 30 September 2024.
In a letter dated 23 January 2026, BASF Agricultural Solutions U.S. LLC informed the Commission that it would change its legal representative in the Union from BASF SE to BASF Agriculture Solutions Belgium NV, and that it would have a new address in Belgium, from 1 July 2026.
The proposed amendments reflect the corporate changes of the holders of the authorisation, Bayer CropScience LLC and BASF Agriculture Solutions US LLC, in the authorisation decisions concerned. They are of a single administrative nature and do not involve a new assessment of the products concerned.
In order to ensure uniform conditions for the implementation of this Regulation, implementing powers should be conferred on the Commission.
The measures provided for in this Decision are in accordance with the opinion of the Standing Committee on Plants, Animals, Food and Life,
This Decision is addressed to BASF Agriculture Solutions US LLC, 2 T.W. Alexander Dr., Durham, NC 2771/3, United States, represented in the Union by BASF Agriculture Solutions Belgium NV, Technopark-Zwjnaarde 101, 9052 Ghent, Belgium.’
